# "Creature spells you control can't be countered." Bot1 resolves Prowling Serpopard on turn 1. On turn 3 Bot2 (holding two
# Counterspells and four mana) counters Bot1's Elvish Mystic - the Counterspell resolves and the Mystic still enters -
# and then counters Bot1's Lightning Bolt, a noncreature spell, which is countered (the positive control): Bot2 stays at 20.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Prowling Serpopard
Mox Ruby
Elvish Mystic
Lightning Bolt
Forest
Forest x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Counterspell
Counterspell
Island
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
